         Project Name: Ecommerce
         Deadline Date: 04/12/2025

         Description of Project
          This Ecommerce project is built on an Nx monorepo architecture, which includes the following packages:

                     Frontend
                      Backend
                    Admin Panel
 The project uses a MySQL database.

 
        Functionality To Be Done

        1. Authentication
        Implement JWT-based Login and Signup for both Admin and Frontend.
         Ensure role-based access and secure token storage.

         2. Product Page

         From the Admin Panel, products can be added, edited, or deleted.

         All changes should directly reflect on the Frontend Product Page.

3. Navbar

Add search functionality in the Navbar.

Users should be able to directly search products using the Navbar.

4. Rewrite the Code

Update the existing code and maintain optimized, clean, and efficient code across all files.

5. Test Cases

Rewrite test cases for all modified files.

Maintain above 90% test coverage.

6. Cart Function

Users can directly add products to the cart and place orders.

Order details should be saved in the database.

7. Order History

Implement a proper UI for Order History in the Admin Panel.

Admin should be able to view all orders and their details.